---
// GitButler promo bar shown under the header on git/tech posts.
---
<div class="bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800/60 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 py-2 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="leading-none text-zinc-300 dark:text-zinc-600">&#x29D3;</span>
        <a href="https://gitbutler.com" class="font-medium text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600">gitbutler.com</a>
        <span>&mdash; What I'm building now: a better version control system</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
